<div role="region" aria-label="Long description for diagram of 3 lines" class="sr-only"><ul><li>Clockwise from top left, the 3 lines are labeled n, r, and s.</li>
<li>Line n intersects both line r and line s.</li>
<li>At the intersection of line n and line r, 1 angle is labeled clockwise from top left as follows:<br>
<ul>
<li>Top left: 162°</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>At the intersection of line n and line s, 1 angle is labeled clockwise from top left as follows:<br>
<ul>
<li>Top left: x°</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>A note indicates the figure is not drawn to scale.</li>
</ul></div></figure></p>
<p style="text-align: left;">In the figure, line <math alttext="n"><mi>n</mi>
</math> intersects lines <math alttext="r"><mi>r</mi>
</math> and <math alttext="s"><mi>s</mi>
</math>. Line <math alttext="r"><mi>r</mi>
</math> is parallel to line <math alttext="s"><mi>s</mi>
</math>. What is the value of <math alttext="x"><mi>x</mi>
</math>?</p>$SATQ$, $SATQ$[]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["162"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["162"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$<p style="text-align: left;">The correct answer is <math alttext="162"><mn>162</mn>
</math>. It's given that line <math alttext="r"><mi>r</mi>
</math> is parallel to line <math alttext="s"><mi>s</mi>
</math>. Since line <math alttext="n"><mi>n</mi>
</math> intersects both lines <math alttext="r"><mi>r</mi>
</math> and <math alttext="s"><mi>s</mi>
</math>, it's a transversal. The angles in the figure marked as <math alttext="162 degree"><mn>162</mn><mo>&deg;</mo></math> and <math alttext="x degree"><mi>x</mi><mo>&deg;</mo></math> are on the same side of the transversal, where one is an interior angle with line <math alttext="s"><mi>s</mi>
</math> as a side, and the other is an exterior angle with line <math alttext="r"><mi>r</mi>
</math> as a side. Thus, the marked angles are corresponding angles. When two parallel lines are intersected by a transversal, corresponding angles are congruent and, therefore, have equal measure. It follows that the value of <math alttext="x"><mi>x</mi>
</math> is <math alttext="162"><mn>162</mn>
</math>.</p>$SATQ$, false, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, $SATQ${"questionId":"5b918ebb","external_id":"8d0aca2e-6014-42d2-adde-c7e271bac2be","disclosed_item_id":null,"source":"qbank","vaultid":null,"uId":"bc8a4320-634b-42c2-a130-8ce40743e473","program":"SAT","test_type":2,"test_type_desc":"Math","primary_class_cd":"S","domain":"Geometry and Trigonometry","skill_cd":"S.B.","skill_desc":"Lines, angles, and triangles","difficulty":"E","score_band_range_cd":2,"type":"spr","stimulus":null,"stem":"<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><figure class='image'><svg height=\"256.342457pt\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 233.967025 256.342457\" width=\"233.967025pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A diagram of 3 lines. Refer to long description.\">\n <defs>\n  <style type=\"text/css\">\n*{stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:round;}\n  </style>\n </defs>\n <g id=\"figure_1\">\n  <g id=\"patch_1\">\n   <path d=\"M 0 256.342457 \nL 233.967025 256.342457 \nL 233.967025 0 \nL 0 0 \nz\n\" style=\"fill:none;\"></path>\n  </g>\n  <g id=\"axes_1\">\n   <g id=\"matplotlib.axis_1\"></g>\n   <g id=\"matplotlib.axis_2\"></g>\n   <g id=\"line2d_1\">\n    <path clip-path=\"url(#p8845c29634)\" d=\"M 7.2 74.429744 \nL 205.9875 74.429744 \n\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:#000000;stroke-linecap:square;stroke-width:0.5;\"></path>\n   </g>\n   <g id=\"line2d_2\">\n    <path clip-path=\"url(#p8845c29634)\" d=\"M 7.2 143.157017 \nL 205.9875 143.157017 \n\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:#000000;stroke-linecap:square;stroke-width:0.5;\"></path>\n   </g>\n   <g id=\"line2d_3\">\n    <path clip-path=\"url(#p8845c29634)\" d=\"M 16.711364 211.88429 \nL 206.938636 22.88429 \n\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:#000000;stroke-linecap:square;stroke-width:0.5;\"></path>\n   </g>\n   <g id=\"text_1\">\n    <!-- 162° -->\n    <defs>\n     <path d=\"M 12.796875 48.4375 \nQ 12.203125 48.734375 11.609375 49.5625 \nQ 11.03125 50.390625 11.031