<div role="region" aria-label="Long description for right triangle" class="sr-only"><ul>
<li>One angle is a right angle.</li>
<li>The measure of a second angle is x°.</li>
<li>The length of the leg opposite the angle with measure x° is 26.</li>
<li>The length of the leg adjacent to the angle with measure x° is 7.</li>
<li>A note indicates the figure is not drawn to scale.</li>
</ul></div></figure></p>
<p style="text-align: left;">In the triangle shown, what is the value of <math alttext="tangent x degree"><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#176;</mo></math>?</p>$SATQ$, $SATQ$[{"id":"70e5b73e-00bd-4652-8611-a026a4be0784","content":"<p><math alttext=\"one twenty sixth\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>26</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p>"},{"id":"5dee550c-44ab-42a5-8b36-f72db1fbaf29","content":"<p><math alttext=\"StartFraction 19 Over 26 EndFraction\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>19</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>26</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p>"},{"id":"8f05fcc2-ee85-4687-a597-a9ed13ac3623","content":"<p><math alttext=\"StartFraction 26 Over 7 EndFraction\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>26</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p>"},{"id":"079fea4b-5c01-4a88-a911-e2700dd8e168","content":"<p><math alttext=\"StartFraction 33 Over 7 EndFraction\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>33</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p>"}]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["C"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["8f05fcc2-ee85-4687-a597-a9ed13ac3623"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$<p style="text-align: left;">Choice C is correct. The tangent of an acute angle in a right triangle is defined as the ratio of the length of the side opposite the angle to the length of the shorter side adjacent to the angle. In the triangle shown, the length of the side opposite the angle with measure <math alttext="x degree"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#176;</mo></math> is <math alttext="26"><mn>26</mn>
</math> units and the length of the side adjacent to the angle with measure <math alttext="x degree"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#176;</mo></math> is <math alttext="7"><mn>7</mn>
</math> units. Therefore, the value of <math alttext="tangent x degree"><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#176;</mo></math> is&nbsp;<math alttext="StartFraction 26 Over 7 EndFraction"><mfrac><mn>26</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac></math>.</p>
<p>Choice A is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>
<p>Choice B is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>
<p>Choice D is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>$SATQ$, false, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, $SATQ$manifold$SATQ$, NULL, NULL, NULL, $SATQ${"questionId":"64c1f044","external_id":"359c6a4b-24df-4f06-8a59-45dbbbb00833","disclosed_item_id":null,"source":"qbank","vaultid":"533df310-6942-48ce-a3fb-57da5963b028","uId":"449dce64-a3d4-4ed2-afe6-0dcc8f5e6314","program":"SAT","test_type":2,"test_type_desc":"Math","primary_class_cd":"S","domain":"Geometry and Trigonometry","skill_cd":"S.C.","skill_desc":"Right triangles and trigonometry","difficulty":"E","score_band_range_cd":2,"type":"mcq","stimulus":null,"stem":"<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><figure class='image'><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"250.0pt\" viewBox=\"0 0 250.0 210.0\" height=\"210.0pt\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A right triangle. Refer to long description.\">\n  <g>\n    <g><defs>\n  <style type=\"text/css\">\n*{stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:round;}\n  </style>\n </defs>\n <g id=\"figure_1\">\n  <g id=\"patch_1\">\n   <path d=\"M 0 197.568  L 244.8 197.568  L 244.8 0  L 0 0  z \" style=\"fill:none;\"></path>\n  </g>\n  <g id=\"axes_1\">\n   <g id=\"patch_2\">\n    <path d=\"M 7.2 190.368  L 237.6 190.368  L 237.6 7.2  L 7.2 7.2  z \" style=\"fill:none;\"></path>\n   </g>\n   <g id=\"matplotlib.axis_1\"></g>\n   <g id=\"matplotlib.axis_2\"></g>\n   <g id=\"text_1\">\n    <!-- $7$ -->\n    <defs>\n     <path d=\"M 44.90625 64.59375  L 23.703125 -0.796875  L 17.203125 -0.796875  L 37 58.796875  L 15.5 58.796875  Q 11.203125 58.796875 9.09375 57.296875  Q 7 55.796875 3.796875 50.59375  L 2 51.5  L 8 66.203125  L 44.90625 66.203125  z \" id=\"STIXGeneral-Regular-55\"></path>\n    </defs>\n    <g transform=\"translate(21.24 98.784)scale(0.18 -0.18)\">\n     <use transform=\"translate(0 0.796875)\" xlink:href=\"#STIXGeneral-Regular-55\"></use>\n    </g>\n   </g>\n   <g id=\"text_2\">\n    <!-- $26$ --