<div role="region" aria-label="Long description for right triangle upper X upper Y upper Z" class="sr-only"><ul><li>Angle upper Z is a right angle.</li>
<li>The length of side upper X upper Z is 27.</li>
<li>The length of side upper Y upper Z is 35.</li>
<li>A note indicates the figure is not drawn to scale.</li>
</ul></div></figure></p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Triangle <math alttext="upper X upper Y upper Z"><mrow>
	<mi>X</mi>
	<mi>Y</mi>
	<mi>Z</mi>
</mrow>
</math> shown is a right triangle. Which of the following has the same value as <math alttext="sine upper X"><mi>sin</mi><mi>X</mi></math>?</p>$SATQ$, $SATQ$[{"id":"cb3eff52-6d9b-4324-b92f-89fca5bbec06","content":"<p><math alttext=\"tangent upper X\"><mi>tan</mi><mi>X</mi></math></p>"},{"id":"e4a2fef5-d378-42de-88c4-0714dd652cbd","content":"<p><math alttext=\"tangent upper Y\"><mi>tan</mi><mi>Y</mi></math></p>"},{"id":"4bdfb81e-eef7-4cd5-a452-c079fbc5901f","content":"<p><math alttext=\"cosine upper X\"><mi>cos</mi><mi>X</mi></math></p>"},{"id":"0812d80c-9ca2-45c6-b66c-b4dd3adc8869","content":"<p><math alttext=\"cosine upper Y\"><mi>cos</mi><mi>Y</mi></math></p>"}]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["D"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["0812d80c-9ca2-45c6-b66c-b4dd3adc8869"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$<p style="text-align: left;">Choice D is correct. The sine of an angle is equal to the cosine of its complementary angle. In the triangle shown, angle <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="upper Z"><mi>Z</mi></math> is a right angle; thus, angles <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="upper X"><mi>X</mi></math> and <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="upper Y"><mi>Y</mi></math> are complementary angles. Therefore,&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="cosine upper Y"><mi>cos</mi><mi>Y</mi></math> has the same value as&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="sine upper X"><mi>sin</mi><mi>X</mi></math>.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Choice A is incorrect and may result from conceptual errors.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Choice B is incorrect and may result from conceptual errors.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Choice C is incorrect and may result from conceptual errors.</p>$SATQ$, false, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, $SATQ${"questionId":"659cb706","external_id":"1673e5c1-c49a-4299-ab8c-5435403ce71d","disclosed_item_id":null,"source":"qbank","vaultid":null,"uId":"10a7166c-bf70-4c2f-b07d-01961086f898","program":"SAT","test_type":2,"test_type_desc":"Math","primary_class_cd":"S","domain":"Geometry and Trigonometry","skill_cd":"S.C.","skill_desc":"Right triangles and trigonometry","difficulty":"M","score_band_range_cd":4,"type":"mcq","stimulus":null,"stem":"<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><figure class='image'><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"250.0pt\" viewBox=\"0 0 250.0 210.0\" height=\"210.0pt\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Right triangle upper X upper Y upper Z. Refer to long description.\">\n  <g>\n    <g><defs>\n  <style type=\"text/css\">\n*{stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:round;}\n  </style>\n </defs>\n <g id=\"figure_1\">\n  <g id=\"patch_1\">\n   <path d=\"M 0 197.568  L 244.8 197.568  L 244.8 0  L 0 0  z \" style=\"fill:none;\"></path>\n  </g>\n  <g id=\"axes_1\">\n   <g id=\"patch_2\">\n    <path d=\"M 7.2 190.368  L 237.6 190.368  L 237.6 7.2  L 7.2 7.2  z \" style=\"fill:none;\"></path>\n   </g>\n   <g id=\"matplotlib.axis_1\"></g>\n   <g id=\"matplotlib.axis_2\"></g>\n   <g id=\"text_1\">\n    <!-- $27$ -->\n    <defs>\n     <path d=\"M 47.40625 13.703125  L 42 0  L 2.90625 0  L 2.90625 1.203125  L 20.703125 20.09375  Q 27.703125 27.40625 30.703125 33.5  Q 33.703125 39.59375 33.703125 46.09375  Q 33.703125 52.796875 30 56.5  Q 26.296875 60.203125 19.796875 60.203125  Q 14.40625 60.203125 11.25 57.390625  Q 8.09375 54.59375 5.09375 47.203125  L 3 47.703125  Q 4.703125 57 9.84375 62.296875  Q 15 67.59375 23.796875 67.59375  Q 32.09375 67.59375 37.1875 62.59375  Q 42.296875 57.59375 42.296875 50  Q 42.296875 38.703125 29.5 25.203125  L 1