 30px sans-serif; }\n\n            /* Note that the color of the text is set with the    *\n            * fill property, the color property is for HTML only */\n            .Rrrrr { font: italic 40px serif; fill: red; }\n        </style>\n    </g>\n</g>\n  </g>\n</svg>\n<div role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Long description for right triangle upper X upper Y upper Z\" class=\"sr-only\"><ul><li>Angle upper Z is a right angle.</li>\n<li>The length of side upper X upper Z is 27.</li>\n<li>The length of side upper Y upper Z is 35.</li>\n<li>A note indicates the figure is not drawn to scale.</li>\n</ul></div></figure></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Triangle <math alttext=\"upper X upper Y upper Z\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>X</mi>\n\t<mi>Y</mi>\n\t<mi>Z</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math> shown is a right triangle. Which of the following has the same value as <math alttext=\"sine upper X\"><mi>sin</mi><mi>X</mi></math>?</p>","answerOptions":[{"id":"cb3eff52-6d9b-4324-b92f-89fca5bbec06","content":"<p><math alttext=\"tangent upper X\"><mi>tan</mi><mi>X</mi></math></p>"},{"id":"e4a2fef5-d378-42de-88c4-0714dd652cbd","content":"<p><math alttext=\"tangent upper Y\"><mi>tan</mi><mi>Y</mi></math></p>"},{"id":"4bdfb81e-eef7-4cd5-a452-c079fbc5901f","content":"<p><math alttext=\"cosine upper X\"><mi>cos</mi><mi>X</mi></math></p>"},{"id":"0812d80c-9ca2-45c6-b66c-b4dd3adc8869","content":"<p><math alttext=\"cosine upper Y\"><mi>cos</mi><mi>Y</mi></math></p>"}],"keys":["0812d80c-9ca2-45c6-b66c-b4dd3adc8869"],"correct_answer":["D"],"rationale":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is correct. The sine of an angle is equal to the cosine of its complementary angle. In the triangle shown, angle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"upper Z\"><mi>Z</mi></math> is a right angle; thus, angles <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"upper X\"><mi>X</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"upper Y\"><mi>Y</mi></math> are complementary angles. Therefore,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"cosine upper Y\"><mi>cos</mi><mi>Y</mi></math> has the same value as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"sine upper X\"><mi>sin</mi><mi>X</mi></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect and may result from conceptual errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect and may result from conceptual errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect and may result from conceptual errors.</p>","parenttemplatename":null,"parenttemplateid":null,"templateclusterid":null,"templateclustername":null,"origin":null,"position":null,"image_count":0,"raw_list":{"updateDate":1755117017716,"pPcc":"SAT#S","questionId":"659cb706","skill_cd":"S.C.","score_band_range_cd":4,"skill_desc":"Right triangles and trigonometry","createDate":1755117017716,"program":"SAT","primary_class_cd_desc":"Geometry and Trigonometry","ibn":"","external_id":"1673e5c1-c49a-4299-ab8c-5435403ce71d","primary_class_cd":"S","uId":"10a7166c-bf70-4c2f-b07d-01961086f898","difficulty":"M"},"raw_detail":{"type":"mcq","stem":"<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><figure class='image'><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"250.0pt\" viewBox=\"0 0 250.0 210.0\" height=\"210.0pt\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Right triangle upper X upper Y upper Z. Refer to long description.\">\n  <g>\n    <g><defs>\n  <style type=\"text/css\">\n*{stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:round;}\n  </style>\n </defs>\n <g id=\"figure_1\">\n  <g id=\"patch_1\">\n   <path d=\"M 0 197.568  L 244.8 197.568  L 244.8 0  L 0 0  z \" style=\"fill:none;\"></path>\n  </g>\n  <g id=\"axes_1\">\n   <g id=\"patch_2\">\n    <path d=\"M 7.2 190.368  L 237.6 190.368  L 237.6 7.2  L 7.2 7.2  z \" style=\"fill:none;\"></path>\n   </g>\n   <g id=\"matplotlib.axis_1\"></g>\n   <g id=\"matplotlib.axis_2\"></g>\n   <g id=\"text_1\">\n   